msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide ran the whole SKQD pipeline on a noiseless statevector simulator. On hardware, the transpiled `circuits` would be executed and measured in place of the statevector sampling in step 6, with the resulting counts feeding the step-7 diagonalization unchanged. Refer to the [Qiskit documentation](/guides/intro-to-patterns) for help running circuits, and to the [SQD addon tutorials](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/overview) for information about the subspace-diagonalization post-processing, including its behavior on noisy samples, where configuration recovery does the most work.\n"
msgstr "Pinatakbo ng gabay na ito ang buong SKQD pipeline sa isang noiseless statevector simulator. Sa hardware, ie-execute at susukatin ang na-transpile na `circuits` kapalit ng statevector sampling sa step 6, at ang mga resultang count ay ipapasok sa step-7 diagonalization nang walang pagbabago. Tingnan ang [Qiskit documentation](/guides/intro-to-patterns) para sa tulong sa pagpapatakbo ng mga circuit, at ang [SQD addon tutorials](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/overview) para sa impormasyon tungkol sa subspace-diagonalization post-processing, kasama ang pag-uugali nito sa mga noisy na sample, kung saan pinakamalaki ang trabaho ng configuration recovery.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the [ffsim relationship guide](ffsim#ffsim-relationship-explanation) to understand why [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") and [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") work natively on this package’s fermionic circuits, and why the fixed-particle-number sector used in step 6 makes the momentum-basis sparsity established in step 2 sample-efficient.\n"
msgstr "Basahin ang [ffsim relationship guide](ffsim#ffsim-relationship-explanation) para maintindihan kung bakit gumagana nang native ang [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") at [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") sa mga fermionic circuit ng package na ito, at kung bakit ang fixed-particle-number sector na ginamit sa step 6 ay ginagawang sample-efficient ang momentum-basis sparsity na itinatag sa step 2.\n"
